BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mindfulness for Stress
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260126T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260126T213000
UID:d88a4953a492319d4d4062f9@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This eight-week evidence-based course is designed to help you 
 manage stress and overwhelm in your life. This course teaches practical mi
 ndfulness tools to reduce stress\, calm anxiety\, and bring balance to dai
 ly life.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindfulness-for-stress-j
 an-26
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Life With Full Attention
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260204T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260204T214500
UID:4be8410e855e4b691be37b9e@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Buddhism’s vision of infinite consciousness\, exemplified by
  the Buddha\, is a vision of our human potential. We’re like an acorn th
 at doesn’t realise its potential is to be an oak tree. But we’re almos
 t perpetually distracted – planning\, worrying and fantasizing.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/life-with-full-attention
 -feb-2026
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Introduction to Buddhism & Meditation Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260223T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260223T224500
UID:b458042e12a0530af6d646b4@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:This six-week course on Monday evenings will introduce you to 
 key Buddhist principles and two meditation practices that cultivate self-a
 wareness\, open-heartedness\, and insight.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/introduction-to-buddhism
 -meditation-course-2026-02-23
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Foundations of Meditation Course
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260224T191500
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260224T223000
UID:063f784063afcd4cf9f745e6@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Our mind is notoriously tricky - hard to manage\, mostly uncon
 scious\, creative and destructive by degrees. What’s crucial is to be ab
 le to work with this tricky ‘non-thing’ called the mind. Buddhism has 
 2\,500 years of experience working with the mind. In this sense\, meditati
 on is at the heart of Buddhism.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/foundations-of-meditatio
 n-course-feb-2026
END:VEVENT
